<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:2e6263f8-c461-4abc-ba24-cd51feab06dd">
              <SHORT-NAME>Com</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the AUTOSAR COM module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Com模块是AUTOSAR通信堆栈的一部分，负责处理应用层和底层网络之间的信号传输，包括信号打包、解包、路由和过滤等功能。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Com模块时，需要确保信号和PDU的映射关系符合项目要求；配置的周期性发送和接收时间参数应满足网络带宽和系统实时性要求；遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对Com配置参数的规范，以确保模块的正确性和兼容性。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00540</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:31da4c36-26a7-4ed7-9350-4d63f12cf7b7">
                  <SHORT-NAME>ComConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the AUTOSAR COM module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComConfig是AUTOSAR通信堆栈的配置容器，它包含了用于配置通信相关功能的参数，如PDU（协议数据单元）的路由策略、IPDU（交互协议数据单元）的定时参数等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComConfig时，必须确保所有的参数与系统的通信需求相匹配，并且遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的数据类型和结构；配置项的属性应当与AUTOSAR规范中的模块配置参数一致，以保证通信堆栈的正确性和可靠性；在多个ECU间共享数据时，需要特别注意PDU的一致性和同步问题。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00337</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ddfe0fcf-ccd7-4dfd-a3c6-cc367bd19c6c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComDataMemSize</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Size of internal Com data in units of bytes (static memory allocation) - memory required by post-build configuration must be smaller than this constant. This parameter is needed only in case of post-build loadable implementation using static memory allocation.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComDataMemSize配置项指定了通信堆栈中用于存储PDU（协议数据单元）的数据区域的大小，确保足够的内存空间用于数据交换。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：必须确保配置的ComDataMemSize足够大，以容纳所有激活的PDU的最大数据量；过小的配置可能导致数据丢失或通信故障；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，该配置项的具体数值需根据系统需求和PDU大小合理计算。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">0</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00783</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2130c8cf-2e10-43c8-b1d7-439d64580048">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMaxIPduCnt</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Maximum number of IPdus. This parameter is needed only in case of post-build loadable implementation using static memory allocation.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMaxIPduCnt 配置项定义了在AUTOSAR Communication Stack中，IPdu（即“Interaction Protocol Data Unit”，交互协议数据单元）的最大数量，这是为了限制系统中可管理的IPdu数量。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMaxIPduCnt时，需要确保其值足以支持系统中所有的IPdu；过小的值可能导致无法配置所有必要的IPdu，而过大的值可能会浪费资源；此配置项的合理设置应基于系统需求和资源限制进行权衡。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">0</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00782</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c290eaea-e207-4f2e-89a5-134d43a125a0">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComGwMapping</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Each instance of this container defines one mapping of the integrated Signal Gateway.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComGwMapping 用于定义通信网关的映射关系，它指定了如何在不同的通信对象之间转发消息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保映射关系不会导致数据循环或冗余传输；映射配置应符合网络带宽和延迟要求；在配置时需考虑消息的优先级和安全性要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00544</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-CHOICE-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:007f74c9-4d99-4605-a6cd-abd1ce2c888c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComGwDestination</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Each instance of this choice container allows to define one routing destination either by reference to an already configured COM signal / group signal or by a  destination description container.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComGwDestination配置项用于定义通信网关中目的地的参数，这包括目标PDU（协议数据单元）的ID和目标PDU的类型，确保数据能正确地从源传输到预定的目标。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComGwDestination时，必须确保目标PDU的ID在整个系统中是唯一的；目标PDU类型应与系统中其他配置的PDU类型保持一致，避免类型不匹配导致的通信故障；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于通信网关的配置有详细规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证系统的兼容性和稳定性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00546</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <CHOICES>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:02fc5539-53d4-4a74-929c-3db3a8a40f03">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComGwDestinationDescription</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Description of a gateway destination. This container allows defining a gateway destination without the configuration of a complete COM signal. This allows adding / changing gateway relations post build without the configuration of new signals.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComGwDestinationDescription配置项用于描述通信网关中目的地消息的详细信息，包括目标PDU的ID、目标PDU的类型等，以便正确地将源消息转发到指定的目的地。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保目标PDU的ID与系统中其他PDU的ID不冲突；正确指定目标PDU的类型，以匹配消息的传输协议和格式；在多目的地转发场景中，需详细规划每个目的地的配置，以避免消息转发错误或丢失。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00549</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0b9384a4-946a-94a7-2a07-5ba84e265ac2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>ComSignalEndianness</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Defines the endianness of the signal's network representation.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00157</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
