                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ae2fd4f0-9482-4454-8bad-fa692d275b39">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComIPduHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The numerical value used as the ID of this I-PDU. The ComIPduHandleId is required by the API calls Com_RxIndication, Com_TpRxIndication, Com_StartOfReception and Com_CopyRxData to receive I-PDUs from the PduR (ComIP-duDirection: Receive), as well as the PduId passed to an Rx-I-PDU-callout. For Tx-I-PDUs (ComIPduDirection: Send), this handle Id is used for the APIs calls Com_TxConfirmation, Com_TriggerTransmit, Com_TriggerIPDUSend or Com_TriggerIPDUSendWithMetaData, Com_CopyTxData and Com_TpTxConfirmation to transmit respectively confirm transmissions of I-PDUs, as well as the PduId passed to the Tx-I-PDU-callout configured with ComIPduCallout and/or ComIPduTriggerTransmitCallout.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComIPduHandleId 是用于唯一标识每个I-PDU（即“协议数据单元”）的句柄，它在AUTOSAR Communication Stack中用于访问和管理I-PDUs。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：ComIPduHandleId 必须在整个项目范围内是唯一的；在配置过程中应确保没有重复的句柄ID，以避免数据传输错误；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，句柄ID通常由配置工具自动生成，以减少人为错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
