                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ec4cc19d-8379-4c52-a8aa-9d4d0f11759c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComSignalGroup</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Contains the configuration parameters of the AUTOSAR COM module's signal groups.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComSignalGroup 是 AUTOSAR Communication Stack 中的一个配置项，用于定义一组信号（ComSignals），这些信号作为一个整体被发送和接收，以优化网络带宽和消息处理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComSignalGroup时，需要确保组内所有信号的更新和传输作为一个原子操作处理；组内信号的打包和解包策略应当一致，以避免数据不一致的问题；在定义信号组时，还需考虑网络带宽和ECU处理能力，以确保信号组的有效管理和传输。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00345</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b4e3fa28-925f-8f6b-5ce0-7b6043abbb94">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComInitialValueOnly</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines that the respective signal's initial value shall be put into the respective PDU but there will not be any update of the value through the RTE. Thus the Com implementation does not need to expect any API calls for this signal (group).</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComInitialValueOnly 配置项用于指定是否仅在通信系统初始化时发送初始值，而在后续的通信周期中不再发送该值，除非该值发生变化。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用ComInitialValueOnly时，需要确保系统设计可以容忍在通信周期中不接收到静态值的更新；此配置项可能会影响系统的诊断和监控策略，因为某些监控系统可能依赖于定期接收的更新；在配置此项时，应仔细考虑与网络管理和唤醒信号的交互，以避免意外的网络行为。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00811</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d0c33bf3-42af-4404-a779-a38b29d790a1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComSignalGroupArrayAccess</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether the uint8-array based access shall be used for this ComSignalGroup.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComSignalGroupArrayAccess 配置项用于定义信号组数组的访问机制，允许对信号组中的信号数组进行索引访问，从而简化对复杂信号组的处理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保信号组中的信号确实是数组类型，以便可以通过索引进行访问；此配置项需要与ComSignalGroup的定义一致，以保证正确的数据访问；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当注意信号组数组访问的内存对齐和数据一致性要求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_10003</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:8faff5fb-dbfc-90de-3ce9-e31ffec662ac">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComDataInvalidAction</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter defines the action performed upon reception of an invalid signal.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComDataInvalidAction配置项用于定义当接收到无效或未定义的信号数据时，通信堆栈应采取的动作，例如可以配置为保持最后有效值或设置为默认值。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComDataInvalidAction时，需要确保所选动作与系统的容错需求相匹配；对于关键信号，考虑使用保持最后有效值以避免因数据无效导致的系统行为不确定；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中明确支持此配置项，但实现细节可能因AUTOSAR版本和供应商实现而异。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Relating to signal groups the action in case if one of the included signals is an invalid signal.
                                                If Replace is used the ComSignalInitValue will be used for the replacement.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00314</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
