                          <SHORT-NAME>ComTransferProperty</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines if a write access to this signal can trigger the transmission of the corresponding I-PDU. If the I-PDU is triggered, depends also on the transmission mode of the corresponding I-PDU.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
