                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:74091fc7-9efd-8c94-661b-0772e0ef6bf2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComFirstTimeout</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the length of the first deadline monitoring timeout period in seconds. This timeout is used immediately after start (or restart) of the deadline monitoring service. The timeout period of the successive periods is configured by ECUC_Com_00263.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComFirstTimeout 配置项用于定义在通信接口模块（Com）中，PDU（协议数据单元）的首次发送超时时间，即在发送第一个PDU副本之前等待的时间。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：ComFirstTimeout 的值应当根据系统的通信需求和性能指标来设定；超时时间设置过短可能导致系统无法在规定时间内完成数据的准备和发送；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的数据类型和单位符合规范要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00183</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
