                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:85fac514-b725-9832-4f29-d9f893069f9e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComNotification</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">On sender side: Name of Com_CbkTxAck callback function to be called.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComNotification 用于定义在接收到特定的通信消息后触发的回调函数，这些回调函数用于处理接收到的消息或执行相关的动作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保回调函数的实现符合实时性和资源消耗的要求；回调函数应避免执行复杂或耗时的操作，以免影响消息处理的效率；在配置ComNotification时，应确保消息标识符与回调函数正确匹配，避免错误触发。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">On receiver side: Name of Com_CbkRxAck callback function to be called.

                                                If this parameter is omitted no notification shall take place.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00498</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
