                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-TYPE>I-SIGNAL-TO-I-PDU-MAPPING</DESTINATION-TYPE>
                        </ECUC-FOREIGN-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:bc99abe1-7836-48fc-a311-6428aaf3773b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComGroupSignal</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters of group signals. I.e. signals that are included within a signal group.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComGroupSignal用于定义一组信号（Signals）的集合，这些信号作为一个整体在通信接口中进行管理和传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在定义ComGroupSignal时，确保所有包含的信号兼容并符合传输协议要求；组内信号的更新策略应统一管理，以避免数据不一致；AutoSAR CP 4.4标准中对信号组的具体实现和限制应详细参考相关通信协议章节。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00520</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c530db4c-b8cc-932f-3a7c-821d5075c2fa">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComSignalEndianness</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the endianness of the signal's network representation.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComSignalEndianness 配置项用于定义通信信号的字节序，指定信号在网络消息中的表示方式是大端（Big Endian）还是小端（Little Endian）。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在定义信号的字节序时，必须确保与网络上其他系统或组件的字节序兼容；错误的字节序配置可能导致数据解析错误，影响系统间的数据交换；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持配置每个信号的字节序，以适应不同网络要求。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00157</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:d3669146-28b9-e2e5-c32e-1b0c235159dd">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>BIG_ENDIAN</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f65dab5b-b208-df39-e4c4-8d804a93d8ae">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>LITTLE_ENDIAN</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:71fc5731-a567-d38a-cfde-f1151ec43e7c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>OPAQUE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c36e63f5-6ddc-93ea-3a22-31dedcffc4fe">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComSignalType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The AUTOSAR type of the signal. Whether or not the signal is signed or unsigned can be found by examining the value of this attribute.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComSignalType 是用于定义通信信号的数据类型，这个配置项指定了信号可以携带的数据类型，如整型、浮点型或布尔型等。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在定义ComSignalType时，需要确保数据类型与应用层期望的数据类型一致；数据类型的选择会影响信号的编码、解码以及传输效率；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应遵循定义的数据类型枚举，不应使用非标准的数据类型。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">This type could also be used to reserved appropriate storage in AUTOSAR COM.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00127</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
