                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2bd0c280-d8db-4a93-b38f-bc18a8578938">
                          <SHORT-NAME>Uint16FifoDepth</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the Depth of Uint16 Type Fifo.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Uint16FifoDepth 配置项用于定义一个UINT16类型的FIFO（可存放2字节数据）缓冲区的深度，即缓冲区可以存储的元素数量。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Uint16FifoDepth时，需要确保缓冲区深度与系统内存资源和性能要求相匹配；过大的FIFO深度可能会导致不必要的内存消耗，而过小可能导致数据溢出或丢失；此配置项应与相关的数据处理速率和任务调度策略相协调。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00710</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2bd0c280-d8db-4a93-b38f-bc18a8578939">
                          <SHORT-NAME>Uint32FifoDepth</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the Depth of Uint32 Type Fifo.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Uint32FifoDepth 配置项用于定义一个UINT32类型的FIFO（可存放4字节数据）缓冲区的深度，即缓冲区可以存储的元素数量。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Uint32FifoDepth时，需要确保队列深度与系统内存和性能要求相匹配；过大的队列深度可能会导致不必要的内存消耗；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确定义，具体实现可能依赖于软件架构或组件的具体要求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00710</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2bd0c280-d8db-4a93-b38f-bc18a8578941">
                          <SHORT-NAME>Uint8_NFifoDepth</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the Depth of Uint8_N Type Fifo.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Uint8_NFifoDepth 是一个配置项，用于指定Uint8_N（用户可自定义大小）队列的深度，这个队列用于存储等待传输的网络帧。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值必须根据系统的缓冲需求和内存限制来设定；过大的值可能会导致不必要的内存消耗，而过小的值可能导致网络帧丢失；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该值应该是一个8位无符号整数，确保配置值在0到255的范围内。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00710</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2bd0c280-d8db-4a93-b38f-bc18a8578942">
                          <SHORT-NAME>Uint8_NFifoSize</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the Size of Uint8_N Type Fifo.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Uint8_NFifoSize 是一个配置项，用于指定Uint8_N（用户可自定义）队列的的大小，这个大小是以字节为单位的，用于存储接收到的网络帧。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置Uint8_NFifoSize时，需要确保FIFO的大小足以容纳预期的网络流量，避免数据丢失；此外，FIFO大小的配置应考虑到系统内存资源的限制，以免造成内存溢出；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，该配置项的数据类型应为无符号8位整数，如果配置的数据类型与此不符，需要进行调整。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00710</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>65535</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2bd0c280-d8db-4a93-b38f-bc18a8578943">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ProxyPeriodicTime</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The period between successive calls to ProxyPeriodicTime in seconds.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ProxyPeriodicTime 配置项用于指定AUTOSAR软件组件中的代理端口（Proxy Port）发送周期性数据的时间间隔，确保周期性数据按照预定的时间间隔发送。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：ProxyPeriodicTime 的值必须与系统的时间基准和调度策略相匹配；在配置周期性发送时间时，应考虑系统的实时性要求和网络带宽限制；如果配置的周期时间与实际的任务调度周期不一致，可能会导致数据发送不准确或者丢失。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The COM module (generator) may rely on the fact that ProxyPeriodicTime is scheduled according to the value configured here.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00186</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
