                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2a2e4d9c-0065-4cfe-ba7b-9a73a0e988db">
                  <SHORT-NAME>ComGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Contains the general configuration parameters of the module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComGeneral是AUTOSAR通信堆栈的一部分，它定义了通用的配置参数，这些参数影响整个通信堆栈的行为，如模块的激活状态、版本信息等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComGeneral时，需要确保所选参数与系统需求相匹配；注意版本兼容性，确保配置项符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准；某些参数可能会影响通信性能，因此需要仔细评估。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00541</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d10dbec7-81b8-4219-9bf2-71a9bfd1d85f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComCancellationSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This parameter enables/disables the cancellation feature:</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComCancellationSupport 配置项用于指定通信堆栈是否支持IPDU（即消息或数据包）的取消传输功能，这允许在传输过程中停止IPDU的发送。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComCancellationSupport时，需要确保底层的通信硬件和驱动支持取消传输的功能；如果启用了取消传输，可能会对系统的实时性和带宽有影响；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应与其他相关配置项（如ComTxIPdu）保持一致性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: enabled
                                        false: disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_10000</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:9bb66a6b-aa9c-4e13-b9d6-a5382d3a4be4">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComConfigurationUseDet</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The error hook shall contain code to call the Det.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComConfigurationUseDet 是一个配置项，用于指定是否在通信堆栈中启用开发错误检测（Development Error Tracer, Det）。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，开发者需要根据系统的诊断需求决定是否启用Det；如果启用，必须确保Det模块已经集成到系统中；在生产代码中通常会禁用Det以节省资源和提高性能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If this parameter is configured COM_DEV_ERROR_DETECT shall be set to ON as output of the configuration tool. (as input for the source code).</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Com_00141</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0777156b-b5c5-45cd-93c3-2d1a66cc8ffe">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComEnableMDTForCyclicTransmission</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables globally for the whole Com module the minimum delay time monitoring for cyclic and repeated transmissions (ComTxModeMode=PERIODIC or ComTxModeMode=MIXED for the cyclic transmissions, ComTxModeNumberOfRepetitions &gt; 0 for repeated transmissions).</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComEnableMDTForCyclicTransmission 配置项用于启用或禁用最小延迟时间（Minimum Delay Time, MDT）机制，该机制用于循环传输的消息，以防止网络上的拥塞。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置最小延迟时间时，需要确保设置的MDT值不会违反网络的带宽限制；MDT设置应考虑到所有周期性消息的传输需求，以避免对实时性能的影响；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项应与网络管理和通信堆栈的其他部分协同工作，以确保整体系统的稳定性和性能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
